WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:06.357
Let's open this five-band cellular signal booster and take a closer look at what comes in the box.

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:12.371
First out is the booster itself.

00:00:12.371 --> 00:00:18.752
Its indoor antenna is built right in, so the basic setup doesn't need a separate indoor antenna.

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:25.813
Next is the coaxial cable.

00:00:25.813 --> 00:00:29.563
It connects the outdoor antenna to the booster inside your home.

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:37.678
This is the directional outdoor antenna.

00:00:37.678 --> 00:00:41.810
Once installed, it picks up the cellular signal available outside.

00:00:47.050 --> 00:00:50.855
The kit also includes the power adapter and mounting hardware.

00:00:50.855 --> 00:00:54.789
Check all the parts against the installation guide before you begin.
